{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t05_01",
      "hash64": "BA36BFB0DDBC3C66",
      "text": "我和摩托蜥穿過沙漠到這裡來，\\n真是累壞了～！\\c\\n不論是人還是寶可夢，\\n都得好好休息才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t05_03",
      "hash64": "BA36BDB0DDBC3900",
      "text": "這裡是漬沁鎮。\\n知名的市場非常熱鬧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t05_08",
      "hash64": "BA36C8B0DDBC4BB1",
      "text": "走過路過不要錯過！\\n新鮮好貨通通有！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t05_10",
      "hash64": "BA33BAB0DDB9FE10",
      "text": "漬沁就是用檸檬汁或醋\\n來醃漬肉或魚的調理方法！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t05_11",
      "hash64": "BA33BBB0DDB9FFC3",
      "text": "這個城鎮的食物\\n非～常地好吃！\\c\\n素材新鮮得活蹦亂跳！\\n就像我一樣喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t05_37",
      "hash64": "BA3A41B0DDBF4F23",
      "text": "這個市場裡面有對戰場！\\c\\n這個地方禁止吵架！\\n一切都用寶可夢對戰來裁定。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t05_38",
      "hash64": "BA3A4EB0DDBF653A",
      "text": "聽說在我出生以前，\\n這個市場總是不斷發生口角！\\c\\n現在不但觀光客變多了，\\n小孩子也能放心地到這裡來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t05_39",
      "hash64": "BA3A4FB0DDBF66ED",
      "text": "這位同學，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也要參加拍賣會嗎？\\c\\n要小心不要喊到太高的價格，\\n最後變成窮光蛋啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t05_52",
      "hash64": "BA4154B0DDC58E1A",
      "text": "到了夜晚，\\n幽靈寶可夢就會出現在城鎮的空中。\\r\\n……到底是為什麼呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t05_66",
      "hash64": "BA4B42B0DDCDC409",
      "text": "從海上吹來的海風\\n真的好舒服喔～！\\c\\n但鋼屬性的寶可夢會被鹽醃，\\n或許牠們不太喜歡？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t05_73",
      "hash64": "BA47BDB0DDCAAC33",
      "text": "坐騎寶可夢非常可靠！\\c\\n偶爾換我來背牠好了！\\n啊哈哈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t05_82",
      "hash64": "BA524EB0DDD3F71B",
      "text": "又是傳單！\\c\\n把傳單揉成一團\\n來跟寶可夢玩好了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t05_83",
      "hash64": "BA524DB0DDD3F568",
      "text": "這個四角形的東西是貨櫃喔。\\c\\n我們會把許多的貨物塞進貨櫃裡，\\n再運送到大海的另一端。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t05_85",
      "hash64": "BA5253B0DDD3FF9A",
      "text": "要去遙遠的地區時，就搭船移動！\\n因為靠坐騎寶可夢的話，會累壞的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t05_86",
      "hash64": "BA5252B0DDD3FDE7",
      "text": "之前我游到對面的岩石區時，\\n看到岩石區的上面好像有什麼東西……！\\c\\n不過不爬上懸崖的話，\\n恐怕是拿不到的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t05_87",
      "hash64": "BA5251B0DDD3FC34",
      "text": "哇～用臉部鏤空板\\n可以拍出很有趣的照片耶！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t05_88",
      "hash64": "BA5248B0DDD3ECE9",
      "text": "那個，我知道是波普海豚沒錯，\\n但肌肉結實的那個是……？\\r\\n有這種寶可夢嗎……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t05_89",
      "hash64": "BA5247B0DDD3EB36",
      "text": "大電海燕在海面上飛翔的樣子，\\n真的很上相呢～\\c\\n那些孩子有時候會在\\n城鎮後方的海灘休息喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t05_95",
      "hash64": "BA4ECFB0DDD0E977",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有去過玻瓶市的\\n海岱俱樂部吃飯嗎？\\c\\n聽說那裡用的是\\n漬沁鎮的新鮮食材喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t05_96",
      "hash64": "BA4ED0B0DDD0EB2A",
      "text": "玻瓶道館的海岱\\n有時候會來這個市場！\\c\\n他要是在拍賣會裡得標，\\n就會開心得手舞足蹈的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t05_97",
      "hash64": "BA4ED1B0DDD0ECDD",
      "text": "我年輕的時候，\\n又是參加拍賣又是愛吵架，\\r\\n各種不安分的事通通少不了我的份。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "t05_121",
      "hash64": "1FEAE788C3102BA5",
      "text": "這個海灘很棒卻沒什麼人知道！\\n大家都被市場給吸引去了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
